    "data": {
      "id": 2300,
      "hub_id": 3015,
      "guid": "redlaser42.uirefresh",
      "name": "UI Refresh",
      "slug": "ui-refresh",
      "teaser": "Refreshed menus and widget toggles",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/3015.png",
      "downloads": 2724,
      "favourites_count": 11,
      "description": "<p>A collection of menu edits made to my tastes.</p>\n<p><strong>Layout Changes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Menus have been refreshed. Mostly deactivating, moving, and scaling UI elements.</li>\n<li>Feature to switch background scenes per map.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Map button on Taskbar:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Adds a button to the taskbar that brings you right to the location select map as a PMC.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Clock Widget:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A clock can be added to your inventory screen. The clock can be set to raid time or system time. The clock is automatically compatible with Immersive Day Night Cycle.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Options to disable various UI elements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Top Glow</li>\n<li>PVE button.</li>\n<li>Version Label.</li>\n<li>Orange beta banner.</li>\n<li>Group Widget on taskbar.</li>\n<li>Show game through the raid-pause and settings screen.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>HUD Options:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Disable the Stance Silhouette.</li>\n<li>Move the Health widget to where the stance widget was.</li>\n<li>Phrase Prompt opacity slider.</li>\n<li>Ammo/Sighting Range opacity slider.</li>\n<li>Minimal Stamina Bars: Hides the movement volume icon and speed and stance slider.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Beta features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Option to skip Raid Settings and Insurance screen.</li>\n<li>Option to show the hideout when in the main menu. <em>(This will automatically load the hideout. Still in beta. While fairly stable, it does not have all the features I want.)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Quick video:</strong>\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vVQKzB5EMqo\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://youtu.be/vVQKzB5EMqo</a></p>\n<p><strong>Please Note!</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatible with Moxo Pixel’s Main Menu Overhaul. The main menu layout in the video is just MoxoPixel’s mod.</li>\n<li>If you want something to be configurable, let me know. Making an F12 settings takes extra work, so I won’t do it for everything by default, but if it’s requested, it’s easy enough make.</li>\n<li>This mod was designed in 16:9 aspect ratio. Some UI elements may be misplaced in widescreen. Please report anything weird and I will do my best to fix it.</li>\n<li>Changes to the raid loading screen background only work in English. (for now)</li>\n<li>If skipping Raid Settings and Insurance, do not hit ESC at the Raid Confirmation page. Use the Back Button or Taskbar, or else you’ll be cursed with a double menu. It’s does not require a restart though, just navigate through the menus again.</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2300/ui-refresh",
